{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "d98e566568013fbb8335bede71c88c6a2ba6b295638f6116beb3bc98bf846080", "ja": "検証・疑似デート！", "zh": "验证‧模拟约会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "656918578b04c91bbbac1cfb456cae80a09870b30d751fe0c6405fc8d26161e3", "ja": "恋を学ぶため、3人と疑似デートをする事に\nなったプロデューサー。百合子は読書デート\nで王道展開に胸をときめかせ、静香は話題の\nうどん屋さんに大感激、プロデューサーに\n大人の魅力を感じ始める。", "zh": "为了理解爱情，三人决定跟制作人来场\n模拟约会。百合子在读书约会中因经典\n桥段而心动不已；静香则是因为去了现在\n正红的乌龙面店，而对制作人充满感激，\n开始感受到他的成人魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "abf25e2623db85b8bc9379f02de8cdacaf5325f518e5aba7197447fbf0a6ff82", "ja": "（なんやかんやあって、恋を学ぶウィルゴの3人と、\n疑似デートをする事になった……）", "zh": "（经历种种过程，『处女座』的三人\n为了理解何谓爱情，决定跟我来场模拟约会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "a43c90a0a217bea297b85afeadbed371712fc1a10f15facf17c87c1cda7544dc", "ja": "ここは、今話題のブックカフェ！？　わぁ、やっぱり\nステキ……さすが{$P$}さん！", "zh": "这里是现在正红的图书咖啡厅！？哇……\n果然好棒……真不愧是{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "dd29f9edb80a9e0184dca9ae3f5de1f21613d18c8a1af7f741d16452081caaa1", "ja": "静香、これ見てくれよ！　最新版の野球名鑑だぜ！？\n静香はどんな投手が好き？　二刀流ってどう思う？", "zh": "静香，你看这个！是最新版的棒球名册耶！！\n静香你喜欢什么类型的投手？你觉得左右开弓怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "9df111352d1a5072972b9c33f1b09e5a5aa0340617fbd3140ef4bd75344dfeb7", "ja": "昴、これ！　『手打ちうどんの歴史・決定版』！\n昴はどんなタイプの麺が好き？　きし麺はどう思う？", "zh": "昴，这个！《手打乌龙面的历史‧决定版》！\n昴你喜欢怎样的面条？你觉得宽扁面怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1004_p", "source_sha256": "89915d0f140be93a4c6db5a60d413d8767c09ac9295a8710d74bee19094c66bf", "ja": "3人とも、気にいってくれたみたいだな。\nちょっと、思ってたのとは違う感じだけど……。", "zh": "她们三个好像都很中意这里呢。\n虽然跟我预料中的反应不太一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "cf9498e96dfbc1fb349844aa9a507719df3e4e6d1d8435b39ca8a79c114ee2ed", "ja": "私も、さっそく本を……。\nええと、ここら辺にあるのは………ああっ！？", "zh": "那我也赶快找本书来看……\n我看看，这一区的书是……啊啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "98cab1c46fa96ac7730f41bbabd248d18f6574bb1ce409736fac7b7732e9e1f1", "ja": "百合子？", "zh": "百合子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "8a04fe9fb08661899d90420aba420b95f5647250f65eb22bfe0c9de7d3d353f6", "ja": "こ、これ！　ずっと絶版になってて、中古でも滅多に\n出回らない、幻のSFですっ！　すごい、夢みたい！！", "zh": "这、这本书！这是传说中早就绝版，连二手市场\n都很少见的科幻小说！太棒了，简直像在做梦！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "107ddf02d771b791398c23ee47569906a7a47f54603648b94554ad9577d19e93", "ja": "あっ、これも読みたかった本……あれも、それも！\nもう私、ここに住みます！　天国はここにありました！", "zh": "啊，这本我也好想看……还有那本，跟那本！\n我决定住在这了！天堂就在这里啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "45f9eb8d1b9efa3483c012a4c78054b5aa6103f3d10b3459df722720c0ae78fd", "ja": "そ、そうか。でも百合子、お店だから……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。可是百合子，这里毕竟是做生意的地方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "708cdd0537e0e11cbb76d2fb130541175de2c28550bea7069d7254df0ab04195", "ja": "はっ！　わ、私ったら、はしゃぎすぎでしたか！？\nブックカフェなんだから、静かにしなきゃ……。", "zh": "啊！我、我真是的，兴奋过头了吗！？\n这里是图书咖啡厅，我得安静点才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "40dfe721411fef307b6d1bfd245477402b46b61600a520f29c0cb2e01be14d1f", "ja": "はぁぁぁっ！！？\nこ、これは……ああっ！　ああっ！", "zh": "啊啊啊啊！！？\n这、这是……啊啊！啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8ef45a660f85f5fbd4509d418201edb7acc0d30ba2f28080bc1dcdebe002df5f", "ja": "ま、まあ、興味ない場所に\n連れてきちゃったよりは、いいかな……！", "zh": "好、好吧，这样总比带她到\n没兴趣的店来得好……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "1fcae04ce211e3531120b814f3349358a0374dba1fca328d8abcdef193c3b1a1", "ja": "せっかくだから、俺も本を読もう。これは……\n『電脳あいどる』か。仕事の役に立つかも……。", "zh": "机会难得，我也来看书吧。这是……\n《电脑偶像》啊，内容或许对工作有些助益……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "b5b9c9684e45fa0dae021af9714b836d199a6fd705cf8836a21cca61fe7f3192", "ja": "あっ、『電脳あいどる』！？　これも、\n読んでみたかった……キャッ！？", "zh": "啊，《电脑偶像》！？\n这本我也好想看……呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "6535d6600955a48b0bba31a1e7b1de5bc460d8772eb80b7e467acb96c0534307", "ja": "おっと、手が当たっちゃったか、ごめん。\n同じ本を取ろうとしてたんだな。はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "哎呀，不小心碰到你的手了，抱歉。\n原来我们刚好想拿同一本书啊，来，给你吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1016_026yur", "source_sha256": "ce5b49e8605e8f6bf3c396ccb07309095e21b9dbfd70ae972e43273fd74fc894", "ja": "あ、え、えっと、その……！", "zh": "啊，呃，呃……这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "26c106b0dc0931ac947d64af60001c3e073bdd64ab289550c6697a202b4c21f4", "ja": "百合子？　遠慮しないで……どうかしたのか？", "zh": "百合子？不用跟我客气……你怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "84cd44008dbeed8c0d5fe959d3d01df3ce99e7c6f0a9262362f8ace45af758a9", "ja": "そんな、こ、こんなベタな展開なのに……\nでも、現実だと、やっぱり……。これが……恋？", "zh": "怎么会这样，明、明明是这么老套的桥段……\n真正遇到时，却还是会心动……难道……这就是爱情？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "62bac174aa53b931c662e2328ef2ebd45a1777a96421fc520cc14dc5a62d44c2", "ja": "きゃーっ！！", "zh": "呀──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "3a13bc0a401bc0fcc58144b21a3bdbcf47ae0e6c2ed74983eaa5adec0fcf51a3", "ja": "ゆ、百合子！？\nどこに行くんだ、百合子ー！", "zh": "百、百合子！？\n你要去哪啊，百合子──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1021_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ee9e6010b9db9ecfd02ec29b3176a9235a2f0ffe65dc3073e2f08282de87cb81", "ja": "（次はお昼も兼ねて、\n話題のうどん屋さんにやって来たんだが……）", "zh": "（接着因为是午餐时间，\n所以到了时下正红的乌龙面店……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "7b267ea846d17ffe2184c1ed3c68efd28416a93323a0b6ddbd8db9ec1c8b76d8", "ja": "は～、すっげー混んでた！\nでもうまかったな～！", "zh": "呼～人超多的！\n不过真好吃呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "6d0e726c4df3e8e62d2c39544f710dd5fc8946837f2ab3f0367b19608ca93a02", "ja": "はい……。\nそうですね……。", "zh": "嗯……\n对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "79a4ecdbfe4e1d9551d90b3330d428cf795cd1421b6a3f36995108797fbba130", "ja": "静香、ごめんな。混雑してたから、\nあまりゆっくり味わえなかったか？", "zh": "静香，抱歉，是不是因为人太多，\n害你没办法慢慢品尝呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "af08206c3b7d06b9a6e1b5c8f1f3e6547d5e7c8fc12516a08eaf6cb37651fab6", "ja": "はい、そうですね……。\n……ぐすっ、うう……っ。", "zh": "嗯，对啊……\n……呜、呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "fc4b108c6626431fe76191a3af8aff07b07fa3c303a1623e4ef39bfd76755501", "ja": "し、静香！？", "zh": "静、静香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "82dfc21d9dec920ee50e6d37b0a59a989c603608be0221eedc73a2411891d459", "ja": "静香ちゃん！？　{$P$}さん！\nいったい静香ちゃんになにをしたんですか！？", "zh": "静香！？{$P$}先生！\n你对静香做了什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1029_p", "source_sha256": "00e1a3883e47eb51f7643aa807bea6a88c537dddf5f61be4a2341460045fc1e9", "ja": "すまなかった、静香！\nせっかくのデートなのに、ガッカリしたよな……！", "zh": "静香，对不起！\n难得的约会，我却让你失望了吧……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "44cf5516472ce38914a0420e5e4656096b40e013df12ad1b2b9b99ee568922fc", "ja": "いえ、その……す、すみません！　違うんです！\nちょっと、感動しちゃって。おいしかった……。", "zh": "啊不，那个……不、不好意思！你们误会了！\n我是感动过头，实在太好吃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1031_047sub", "source_sha256": "fb3fa67dbd0eb388b0a7ddd360208b8ab426ac266d63908cf0de3d3778e9cc51", "ja": "ええっ！？　うまかったの！？\nだったら、泣くことないだろー！", "zh": "咦咦！？太好吃！？\n那样有什么好哭的啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "f9a1ddae85fe6a099577b59f1053ac28005a165193f621f7a87535df9ea631ed", "ja": "な、泣いてないです！　でも、こんなにおうどんの\nおいしいお店が近くにあったなんて、うれしくて……。", "zh": "我、我没哭！只是发现原来附近\n就有这么好吃的乌龙面，觉得太开心才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1033_015siz", "source_sha256": "2b3b94bac71770456ac2e29fd4170e62002aa835561e858b856cd570230cd9c9", "ja": "こんな素敵なお店を知ってるなんて、やっぱり\n{$P$}は、大人……なんですね……。", "zh": "居然知道这么棒的店，\n{$P$}果然……很成熟呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "c7065f61d9c6dfa6190a3b6d29be00b6e7bc2cfdfe8f4951a847b666edba21db", "ja": "静香ちゃん、{$P$}さんに大人の\n包容力を感じたんだね！　それってやっぱり、恋！？", "zh": "静香，你从{$P$}先生身上\n感受到了大人的包容力吧！这会不会就是恋爱！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1035_015siz", "source_sha256": "86be203bf7bf9e868ed4bfc2fdb523bfaf71885a510ed4172fdbd0eda0c7cc3a", "ja": "ち、ちがいます！　これはデートのまねっこですよ？\n{$P$}に、恋なんてするわけ……！", "zh": "才、才不是！这场约会只是模拟吧？\n我怎么可能真的喜欢上{$P$}……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ad4bc3630993ce98bd36ea5b13b5bc0a4248432099233cf0b7e25c442069ad2", "ja": "で、でも、大人の包容力を感じたのは、\n本当、かも……。", "zh": "不、不过，或许真的有感受到\n大人的包容力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "97f20c6ce74494f9df2e8e9cd515b7453c0db2166d1f2381eca1fa5bbc2a0831", "ja": "おおお～！？　それっていい感じなんじゃないの！？\nなぁ、{$P$}！", "zh": "喔喔喔～！？这样不是挺棒的吗！？\n{$P$}，你说是不是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "17ce2079b03c12e3a4f8ca16c63c842d2fba3dd0925fc5b688bafc1778dab896", "ja": "うん、恋を学ぶにはいい傾向なんじゃないかと思う。\nよかったじゃないか、静香！", "zh": "嗯，就理解爱情来说应该算是好事。\n恭喜你啊，静香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1039_015siz", "source_sha256": "7db91eb1327d10dfeefab0dfd7bca9868cd3554d32c2de8b70f74b7a9f73bb31", "ja": "よ、よかったとか……{$P$}、\n自分で言わないでください！　もうっ！", "zh": "什、什么恭喜……{$P$}，\n你不要自己讲这种话啦！真是的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0085_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_04_1040_p", "source_sha256": "e4e98cb2eb99a9724cc3ac9544da6cd3b30f558495152c302e66def5e44ee9ca", "ja": "（今回は上手くいったけど、やっぱり予定通りでないと\nデート成功とは言えないかな……。教訓にしよう！）", "zh": "（这次虽然挺顺利的，但约会没照计划走，\n就不算成功吧……我得学会这个教训！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
